            "title": "國際｜歐股三大指數齊以全日低位收市 英法德跌幅均近1%",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"國際｜歐股三大指數齊以全日低位收市 英法德跌幅均近1%\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/20345318f15d27cc99e59aefdd6321d86cd4233ba904bcb9dfd9a8f7bc749151/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">國際｜歐股三大指數齊以全日低位收市 英法德跌幅均近1%</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">歐洲股市全線受壓，英國、法國及德國主要指數均以全日低位收市，跌幅同告接近1%或以上。英國富時100指數收報10452點，下滑98點，跌幅逾0.9%，連跌四個交易日，創六星期新低。德國DAX指數收報25463點，跌272點，跌幅約1.1%，見近一個月低位。法國CAC指數收報8080點，跌66點，跌幅0.8%，錄得四連跌，為逾半個月新低。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B-%E6%AD%90%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A7%E6%8C%87%E6%95%B8%E9%BD%8A%E4%BB%A5%E5%85%A8%E6%97%A5%E4%BD%8E%E4%BD%8D%E6%94%B6%E5%B8%82-%E8%8B%B1%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%B7%E8%B7%8C%E5%B9%85%E5%9D%87%E8%BF%911-223053562.html",
